      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOSSY WITCH (6) rocketed out of the inside draw with a strong early sectional and gave a sight but had to settle for a placing, finishing second (20.20) at Q Lakeside over 352m. Sure to be about the mark. SUNSHINE SCRUB (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing eighth (21.25) in a Maiden at Q Lakeside. Can measure up this time. TOO MANY WORDS (3) is yet to break through in 10 starts but has run a number of placings. Hit the frame again last start finishing second (20.10) at this track. Expected to be in this for a long way. JAKARI BUDGIE (1) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
